# =============================================
#  LinkedIn Profile API — Environment Variables
#  Copy this file to .env and fill in values.
#  NEVER commit the .env file to git.
# =============================================

# -----------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO GET YOUR LINKEDIN COOKIES
# -----------------------------------------------
#  1. Open Chrome / Firefox and log in to LinkedIn.
#  2. Press F12 → Application tab (Chrome) or Storage tab (Firefox).
#  3. Navigate to Cookies → https://www.linkedin.com
#  4. Copy the VALUE of the "li_at" cookie → paste below.
#  5. Copy the VALUE of the "JSESSIONID" cookie → paste below.
#      (it looks like: "ajax:12345678901234567")
#  6. Save this file as .env (not .env.example).
#
#  ⚠️  These cookies expire periodically (usually every few weeks).
#      When you get 401 errors, refresh them from your browser.
# -----------------------------------------------

LI_AT=your_li_at_cookie_value_here
JSESSIONID="ajax:your_jsessionid_value_here"
